      "@type": "ToxicityAssessment",
      "instance_name": "toxicity_1",
      "label": "Harmful",
      "description": "The meme conveys a potentially painful emotional state of social exclusion and alienation, which can be emotionally taxing and may resonate with individuals who feel marginalized or out of place. While not targeting specific protected groups, the expression of social disconnection can be harmful to those experiencing isolation.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
